# Third-party SDKs — not committed; download separately per docs/PLATFORMS.md.
# Dot Inc's Dot Pad SDK is ~850MB across all platforms and vendor-licensed.
# The build's CopyDotPadSdkWindows target skips gracefully if the SDK is missing.
dotpad-sdk/

